        "original_id": "4722ef85-76f7-56fd-8c55-420148d10dd3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Celebrity Apprentice 3, The Apprentice 9\n- People: Bret Michaels\n- Organizations: Poison, Billboard Hot 100\n- Topics: reality game shows, music chart performance\n\nFacts:\n- The Celebrity Apprentice 3, also known as The Apprentice 9, is the ninth installment of the reality game show Celebrity Apprentice.\n- On Sunday, May 23, 2010, the two-hour season finale of The Celebrity Apprentice 3 aired from 9–11 p.m. ET/PT.\n- Bret Michael Sychak was born on March 15, 1963, and he is professionally known as Bret Michaels.\n- Bret Michaels is an American singer-songwriter and musician.\n- On May 23, 2010, Bret Michaels, the lead singer of Poison and a Rock of Love star, won The Celebrity Apprentice 3.\n- Poison has charted ten singles in the Top 40 of the Billboard Hot 100, including six Top 10 singles and the number-one single \"Every Rose Has Its Thorn\".",
